  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Design of 3d phase of Community Policing in Albania</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Design of 3d phase of Community Policing in Albania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xf6;rbereder projektf&#xf6;rslaget f&#xf6;r genomf&#xf6;randet av fas 3 av gemenskapspolisen i Albanien.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preparing the project proposal for the implementation of the phase 3 of Community Policing in Albania.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this intervention is to design the third phase of the Strengthening Community Policing Programme in Albania, through the mobilization of an expert team from DECAF, made  up by international and national consultants. 

The third phase will be designed in response to the Albanian State Police request for a continuation of the ongoing second phase of the cooperation programme. The request has also delineated  the directions and  the scope of the third phase.</narrative>
  </description>
